{"id":373,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"While basking in the joy of flight generally keeps this Pokémon in high spirits, Salamence turns into an uncontrollable menace if something angers it."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Salamence is an unusual Pokémon in that it was able to evolve a body with wings just by constantly wishing to be able to fly."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Thanks to its fervent wishes, the cells in its body finally mutated, and at last it has its heart’s desire—wings."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Overjoyed at finally being able to fly, it flies all over the place and usually doesn’t land until it’s completely exhausted and needs to sleep."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It flies around on its wings, which have grown in at last. In its happiness, it gushes hot flames, burning up the fields it passes over."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"When angered, it loses all sense of itself and destroys everything around it. The destruction will continue until Salamence has tired itself out."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"By evolving into Salamence, this Pokémon finally realizes its long-held dream of growing wings. To express its joy, it flies and wheels all over the sky while spouting flames from its mouth."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Salamence came about as a result of a strong, long-held dream of growing wings. It is said that this powerful desire triggered a sudden mutation in this Pokémon’s cells, causing it to sprout its magnificent wings."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It’s uncontrollable if enraged. It flies around spouting flames and scorching fields and mountains."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It becomes uncontrollable if it is enraged. It destroys everything with shredding claws and fire."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"After many long years, its cellular structure underwent a sudden mutation to grow wings. When angered, it loses all thought and rampages out of control."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":false,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."},{"name":"Moxie","hidden":true,"description":"When the Pokémon knocks out a target, it shows moxie, which boosts its Attack stat."}],"eggGroups":["Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Blue","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":371,"name":"Bagon","condition":null,"children":[{"id":372,"name":"Shelgon","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[{"id":373,"name":"Salamence","condition":"Lv. 50","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,19],[1,43],[1,44],[1,52],[1,182],[1,225],[1,355],[1,525],[1,814],[15,29],[20,184],[25,242],[33,337],[39,428],[46,116],[55,53],[73,38]],"machine":[332,403,34,784,280,523,242,38,434,913,337,349,406,525,814,89,203,263,126,424,83,53,19,416,257,270,542,56,63,304,334,442,189,200,182,706,240,156,46,157,317,184,421,214,444,164,241,129,366,36,915,851,422,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-156","name":"Salamence ex","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Special Illustration Rare","number":"156","artist":"Ryota Murayama","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-156/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-156/large"},{"id":"me55-109","name":"Salamence ex","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"109","artist":"5ban Graphics","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-109/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-109/large"},{"id":"sv9-114","name":"Salamence ex","set":"Journey Together","date":"2025-03-28","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"114","artist":null,"img":"sv9/114"},{"id":"sv9-177","name"